<title>RUSSIA: Three Moscow boys die while playing with grenade.</title>
<headline>Three Moscow boys die while playing with grenade.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three teenaged boys were killed and three were critically injured when a live grenade they were playing with exploded, police said on Friday.</p>
<p>The accident occurred on Thursday night in northeastern Moscow.</p>
</text>
